  "label": "The text 'don't worry' is mapped onto Nancy Pelosi's smiling expression.",
  "description": "The text 'don't worry' is positioned above Nancy Pelosi's head, visually associating her smiling expression with the reassuring tone of the text. This creates an analogical mapping where her facial expression (a visual element) is interpreted as conveying the sentiment expressed in the text. The smile is mapped onto the reassuring message, implying that her demeanor is meant to comfort or reassure the viewer, despite the misleading content of the subsequent text.",
